        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly,\nthe same is negatived."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6108ada8be9b4dcaa87e5a409af09c1e_53",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the claimant would be entitled to the compensation of Rs.5,28,000/- (Rs.12,500/- x 12 x 16 x 22%) towards loss of future income as against Rs.1,92,000/-\nawarded by the tribunal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "132a7992d5ea4d3b931fb1d098b4a5f0_54",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. The tribunal awarded Rs.50,000/- towards pain and suffering and Rs.40,000/- towards food and nourishment, which do not call for interference and the same is retained."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "062ff8c955b64b61b873bb117bcb82c5_55",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
