        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. Towards medical expenses, Rs.65,065/- is awarded by the tribunal on the basis of actual bills produced by the claimant, which also does not call for interference and the same is retained."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b29d686d2b6b490cbb9c355a24b30f20_56",
      "summary_section": "decision",
